<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:01:34.042" end="00:01:35.042" style="s2">Wait!</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.792" end="00:01:41.875" style="s2">She is close.</p>
<p begin="00:01:42.458" end="00:01:45.708" style="s2">We will have the dragons<br />by night for the master.</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.125" end="00:01:47.125" style="s2">Bet.</p>
<p begin="00:02:59.708" end="00:03:00.792" style="s2">Where am I going?</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.167" end="00:03:03.583" style="s2">What am I supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.500" end="00:03:08.750" style="s2">Five dragons,</p>
<p begin="00:03:09.333" end="00:03:10.625" style="s2">and no one to turn to.</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.625" end="00:03:16.167" style="s2">Is my family still alive?</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.708" end="00:04:04.333" style="s2">Run, little girl!</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.042" end="00:04:11.417" style="s2">Leave the dragons unharmed! Kill the girl!</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.250" end="00:04:20.250" style="s2">You can&#39;t outrun us!</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.083" end="00:05:05.333" style="s2">Give us the dragons and you walk away.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.208" end="00:05:08.208" style="s2">Come and get them.</p>
<p begin="00:06:08.583" end="00:06:09.583" style="s2">Girl,</p>
<p begin="00:06:09.917" end="00:06:12.000" style="s2">you can&#39;t beat all five of us.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.833" end="00:06:13.833" style="s2">Maybe not,</p>
<p begin="00:06:14.583" end="00:06:15.875" style="s2">but I&#39;m willing to try.</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.542" end="00:06:45.292" style="s2">You should have walked away, girl.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.875" end="00:06:47.083" style="s2">Now you die.</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.375" end="00:07:33.375" style="s2">Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.458" end="00:07:35.458" style="s2">I&#39;m Soren,</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.000" end="00:07:37.375" style="s2">one of the forest guardians.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.583" end="00:07:40.500" style="s2">And</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.625" end="00:07:42.667" style="s2">you must be Freya,</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.208" end="00:07:44.333" style="s2">Mother of Dragons.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.250" end="00:07:46.417" style="s2">How do you know that?</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.250" end="00:07:49.375" style="s2">The trees talk.</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.708" end="00:07:51.792" style="s2">You&#39;re quite famous now.</p>
<p begin="00:08:00.500" end="00:08:02.250" style="s2">Those creatures took my family.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.458" end="00:08:04.458" style="s2">Your family?</p>
<p begin="00:08:04.875" end="00:08:06.875" style="s2">I don&#39;t even know where<br />they&#39;ve taken them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:07.542" end="00:08:08.750" style="s2">What are those things?</p>
<p begin="00:08:11.375" end="00:08:12.375" style="s2">Orcs.</p>
<p begin="00:08:13.167" end="00:08:14.333" style="s2">They serve Malachar,</p>
<p begin="00:08:14.625" end="00:08:15.625" style="s2">the Dark Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:08:17.458" end="00:08:18.500" style="s2">The Dark Lord?</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.792" end="00:08:21.625" style="s2">The one they call the Prince of Darkness.</p>
<p begin="00:08:24.792" end="00:08:25.917" style="s2">What does he want?</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.042" end="00:08:29.667" style="s2">He&#39;s building fortresses and<br />temples across the world,</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.500" end="00:08:31.792" style="s2">gathering his forces.</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.750" end="00:08:33.750" style="s2">For a war?</p>
<p begin="00:08:34.750" end="00:08:35.750" style="s2">Not just a war.</p>
<p begin="00:08:36.958" end="00:08:38.375" style="s2">He&#39;s trying to bring back Varos,</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.375" end="00:08:40.375" style="s2">the Dark King.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.083" end="00:08:45.083" style="s2">And my family?</p>
<p begin="00:08:47.417" end="00:08:48.750" style="s2">I don&#39;t know where they are, Freya,</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.917" end="00:08:50.917" style="s2">but we&#39;ll look for them.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.333" end="00:08:54.208" style="s2">I&#39;m not leaving them with those things.</p>
<p begin="00:09:26.333" end="00:09:27.333" style="s2">Here you are,</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.750" end="00:09:28.750" style="s2">with five.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.833" end="00:09:31.375" style="s2">That&#39;s why the orcs wanted them?</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.917" end="00:09:32.917" style="s2">Yes,</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.042" end="00:09:34.542" style="s2">before their power awakens.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.000" end="00:09:36.000" style="s2">Why?</p>
<p begin="00:09:36.375" end="00:09:37.833" style="s2">He already has dragons.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.875" end="00:09:43.208" style="s2">A white dragon&#39;s magic is the only<br />thing that can stop the darkness.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.208" end="00:09:45.750" style="s2">These five could stop him?</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.125" end="00:09:47.125" style="s2">Their magic could,</p>
<p begin="00:09:47.708" end="00:09:48.708" style="s2">and he knows it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.250" end="00:09:52.917" style="s2">He&#39;s already taken my family.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.333" end="00:09:54.667" style="s2">He&#39;s not taking them too.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.167" end="00:09:58.250" style="s2">What will you do now?</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.500" end="00:10:01.500" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.000" end="00:10:03.667" style="s2">I can&#39;t abandon my family</p>
<p begin="00:10:04.000" end="00:10:05.167" style="s2">or these little ones.</p>
<p begin="00:10:08.500" end="00:10:09.500" style="s2">Follow me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.917" end="00:10:11.333" style="s2">I&#39;ll take you somewhere safe.</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.000" end="00:10:13.500" style="s2">Safe? Where?</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.417" end="00:10:16.958" style="s2">Somewhere we can rest<br />and decide our next move.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.375" end="00:10:22.083" style="s2">You expect me to just trust you?</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.250" end="00:10:24.250" style="s2">No,</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.333" end="00:10:25.542" style="s2">not just like that.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.958" end="00:10:27.458" style="s2">But you don&#39;t have to face this alone.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.292" end="00:10:32.958" style="s2">And you&#39;ll help me find my family.</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.917" end="00:10:34.917" style="s2">I&#39;ll help you look.</p>
<p begin="00:10:36.292" end="00:10:37.292" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.583" end="00:10:38.583" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow you.</p>
<p begin="00:10:39.250" end="00:10:40.250" style="s2">For now.</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.333" end="00:10:42.333" style="s2">Fair enough.</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.167" end="00:10:59.625" style="s2">They&#39;ve worked us since dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.125" end="00:11:01.958" style="s2">Save your breath. Pull.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.083" end="00:11:04.708" style="s2">We&#39;re building their damn temple.</p>
<p begin="00:11:05.375" end="00:11:06.583" style="s2">Lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.542" end="00:11:08.542" style="s2">Push, I say!</p>
<p begin="00:11:11.208" end="00:11:12.542" style="s2">Keep moving!</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.417" end="00:11:14.917" style="s2">Touch him again. Leap!</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.792" end="00:11:16.792" style="s2">Not here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.000" end="00:11:18.000" style="s2">Look at me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.375" end="00:11:19.458" style="s2">We stay together.</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.833" end="00:11:30.208" style="s2">They&#39;re not going to stop.</p>
<p begin="00:11:35.400" end="00:11:38.500" style="s2">Put the stone down. They&#39;re hurting her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.458" end="00:11:40.542" style="s2">And they&#39;ll kill you</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.792" end="00:11:42.125" style="s2">if you give them a reason.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.208" end="00:11:48.333" style="s2">I&#39;m still standing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.958" end="00:11:51.292" style="s2">We can&#39;t live like this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.833" end="00:11:54.542" style="s2">Then live long enough to change it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.833" end="00:12:00.250" style="s2">Has anyone seen Freya?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.292" end="00:12:02.500" style="s2">Not since the village.</p>
<p begin="00:12:05.000" end="00:12:06.583" style="s2">She was in the woods when they came.</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.083" end="00:12:09.292" style="s2">What if she came back?</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.542" end="00:12:11.542" style="s2">Ingrid.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.000" end="00:12:14.125" style="s2">What if they found her?</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.250" end="00:12:18.333" style="s2">She knows those woods<br />better than any of us.</p>
<p begin="00:12:19.792" end="00:12:21.333" style="s2">Then we pray she kept running.</p>
<p begin="00:12:22.583" end="00:12:24.250" style="s2">I just need to know she&#39;s alive.</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.917" end="00:12:29.000" style="s2">Tools down!</p>
<p begin="00:12:29.250" end="00:12:30.250" style="s2">Move!</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.042" end="00:12:33.042" style="s2">Stay close.</p>
<p begin="00:12:34.833" end="00:12:36.083" style="s2">Where are they taking us?</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.042" end="00:12:38.042" style="s2">Cages.</p>
<p begin="00:12:38.583" end="00:12:39.583" style="s2">Keep your head down.</p>
<p begin="00:12:40.500" end="00:12:42.042" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them separate us.</p>
<p begin="00:12:42.333" end="00:12:43.333" style="s2">They won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.417" end="00:12:44.417" style="s2">Hold on to me.</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.500" end="00:12:48.792" style="s2">Eyes forward!</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.917" end="00:12:58.958" style="s2">Inside.</p>
<p begin="00:13:00.125" end="00:13:01.208" style="s2">All three of us,</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.667" end="00:13:02.667" style="s2">together.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.917" end="00:13:03.917" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.958" end="00:13:04.792" style="s2">Leap,</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.833" end="00:13:07.083" style="s2">come. I&#39;m here, both of you in.</p>
<p begin="00:13:15.875" end="00:13:17.375" style="s2">I can&#39;t bear not knowing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:17.667" end="00:13:18.667" style="s2">About Freya?</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.042" end="00:13:20.042" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:20.333" end="00:13:21.708" style="s2">We don&#39;t know what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.042" end="00:13:23.042" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.667" end="00:13:28.792" style="s2">I used to laugh at her.</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.417" end="00:13:30.417" style="s2">That wooden sword.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.250" end="00:13:32.250" style="s2">So did I.</p>
<p begin="00:13:32.917" end="00:13:34.333" style="s2">She never stopped trying.</p>
<p begin="00:13:36.708" end="00:13:38.042" style="s2">What if she&#39;s alone out there?</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.083" end="00:13:40.708" style="s2">Then I hope she keeps moving.</p>
<p begin="00:13:42.000" end="00:13:43.500" style="s2">And if she&#39;s looking for us?</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.000" end="00:13:46.167" style="s2">She mustn&#39;t come here.</p>
<p begin="00:13:47.208" end="00:13:48.542" style="s2">She won&#39;t give up on us.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.167" end="00:13:51.667" style="s2">Then we don&#39;t give up on her.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.833" end="00:14:02.708" style="s2">The last companies have arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:14:03.958" end="00:14:04.958" style="s2">How many?</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.250" end="00:14:06.250" style="s2">Ten thousand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:06.667" end="00:14:08.250" style="s2">Every banner has answered.</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.792" end="00:14:15.208" style="s2">Malachar will have his army.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.000" end="00:14:18.583" style="s2">He&#39;ll have an army that obeys?</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.042" end="00:14:29.625" style="s2">Shields forward. Close the gaps.</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.583" end="00:14:34.917" style="s2">Pikes upright. Keep the aisle clear.</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.083" end="00:14:41.333" style="s2">Steel is nothing without nerve.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.208" end="00:14:44.292" style="s2">Mine won&#39;t break.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.083" end="00:14:47.125" style="s2">Then hold the line when it matters.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.667" end="00:15:06.167" style="s2">Keep them off the infantry.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.708" end="00:15:08.750" style="s2">They&#39;ve been restless since sundown.</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.250" end="00:15:12.167" style="s2">Then keep a tighter rein.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.875" end="00:15:15.125" style="s2">They feel what gathers here.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.750" end="00:15:17.958" style="s2">They move when I command it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:32.583" end="00:15:35.000" style="s2">Keep the trolls behind<br />the shield companies.</p>
<p begin="00:15:36.167" end="00:15:40.042" style="s2">Let them see what follows us.<br />Strength is easy.</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.458" end="00:15:42.292" style="s2">Obedience is rarer.</p>
<p begin="00:15:42.792" end="00:15:44.625" style="s2">Then they had better learn.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.000" end="00:15:59.625" style="s2">Malachar wants the roads before dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.250" end="00:16:02.333" style="s2">Then we must leave tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:16:04.000" end="00:16:05.000" style="s2">And Varos?</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.792" end="00:16:07.792" style="s2">The temples are not ready.</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.167" end="00:16:09.208" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.708" end="00:16:12.500" style="s2">But every stone brings him closer.</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.167" end="00:16:15.667" style="s2">Then give me time.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.125" end="00:16:18.500" style="s2">Take it from our enemies.</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.833" end="00:16:29.042" style="s2">They called us beasts.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.125" end="00:16:36.667" style="s2">They built their walls and<br />thought we would stay beyond them.</p>
<p begin="00:16:39.875" end="00:16:41.208" style="s2">Look around you.</p>
<p begin="00:16:42.042" end="00:16:45.333" style="s2">Ten thousand stand beneath one banner.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.667" end="00:16:46.667" style="s2">Tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.958" end="00:16:49.167" style="s2">the world will hear us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.958" end="00:16:58.458" style="s2">No banner breaks from the host.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.208" end="00:17:01.500" style="s2">No company falls behind.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.583" end="00:17:06.625" style="s2">We march as one.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.958" end="00:17:11.167" style="s2">Let their watches count our torches.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.625" end="00:17:14.958" style="s2">Let them learn how long the night can be.</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.083" end="00:17:22.625" style="s2">For Malachar! For Malachar! For Malachar!</p>
<p begin="00:17:29.875" end="00:17:32.000" style="s2">The Old King sleeps.</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.375" end="00:17:36.250" style="s2">Do not mistake sleep for death.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.750" end="00:17:42.750" style="s2">Let him wake to a world that is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:17:43.042" end="00:17:46.625" style="s2">Then carry the darkness<br />beyond these walls.</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.042" end="00:18:04.042" style="s2">The night opens for us.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.625" end="00:18:08.125" style="s2">Then let it remember our steps.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.167" end="00:18:19.042" style="s2">Infantry first, riders on<br />the flanks, trolls behind.</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.083" end="00:18:21.833" style="s2">Standards forward, make room!</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.375" end="00:18:31.375" style="s2">Ashborn,</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.708" end="00:18:32.792" style="s2">forward!</p>
<p begin="00:18:36.042" end="00:18:37.333" style="s2">Keep the pace!</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.583" end="00:18:51.750" style="s2">By dawn, they will know we&#39;re coming.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.917" end="00:18:54.375" style="s2">Let them watch.</p>
<p begin="00:18:55.208" end="00:18:57.458" style="s2">Let them count the torches.</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.750" end="00:19:19.375" style="s2">Does this forest ever end?</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.792" end="00:19:21.000" style="s2">Not before nightfall.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.417" end="00:19:22.417" style="s2">Keep walking.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.292" end="00:19:26.833" style="s2">He said that two hills ago.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.292" end="00:19:29.917" style="s2">And I was right both times.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.625" end="00:19:35.917" style="s2">Heads down, little ones.</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.208" end="00:19:46.208" style="s2">We need to stop.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.583" end="00:19:48.083" style="s2">You can barely keep your eyes open.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.042" end="00:19:50.042" style="s2">I&#39;m fine.</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.333" end="00:19:53.333" style="s2">They aren&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:19:53.833" end="00:19:55.042" style="s2">Is there somewhere safe?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.375" end="00:19:57.333" style="s2">There,</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.375" end="00:19:59.833" style="s2">beneath that old pine,<br />we can rest till dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:20:05.000" end="00:20:06.000" style="s2">How can you tell?</p>
<p begin="00:20:07.458" end="00:20:08.458" style="s2">I know these woods.</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.583" end="00:20:19.917" style="s2">A bed made of branches?</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.542" end="00:20:22.042" style="s2">Better than sleeping on the snow.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.292" end="00:20:34.917" style="s2">Won&#39;t the fire draw attention?</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.667" end="00:20:37.667" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep it small.</p>
<p begin="00:20:45.000" end="00:20:46.583" style="s2">You did that without flint.</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.292" end="00:20:48.333" style="s2">Only a spark.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.900" end="00:20:52.958" style="s2">You said you&#39;re a guardian.</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.542" end="00:20:54.542" style="s2">What does that mean?</p>
<p begin="00:20:55.333" end="00:20:56.667" style="s2">I protect the forest</p>
<p begin="00:20:57.292" end="00:20:58.500" style="s2">from the darkness</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.000" end="00:21:00.542" style="s2">and from people who would harm it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.667" end="00:21:02.708" style="s2">And the magic?</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.583" end="00:21:05.083" style="s2">It helps me keep that promise.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.708" end="00:21:13.375" style="s2">Tell me about the white dragons.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.083" end="00:21:16.583" style="s2">Nobody knows where they came from.</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.042" end="00:21:19.042" style="s2">Or what they are.</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.542" end="00:21:22.250" style="s2">Not even the oldest songs say.</p>
<p begin="00:21:25.208" end="00:21:30.250" style="s2">That&#39;s why the Dark Lord wants them.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.542" end="00:21:32.542" style="s2">What would he do?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.958" end="00:21:34.458" style="s2">Turn them into something dark.</p>
<p begin="00:21:35.917" end="00:21:37.375" style="s2">Then he&#39;ll have to get past me.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.167" end="00:21:44.042" style="s2">They can barely keep their eyes open.</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.542" end="00:21:45.542" style="s2">Get some sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.000" end="00:21:47.083" style="s2">I will keep watch.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.625" end="00:21:49.625" style="s2">And you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.833" end="00:21:51.833" style="s2">I&#39;ll be here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.792" end="00:22:03.792" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.375" end="00:22:06.375" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.667" end="00:22:23.042" style="s2">Keep the line! Torches high!</p>
<p begin="00:22:25.958" end="00:22:27.833" style="s2">My feet are frozen!</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.125" end="00:22:29.875" style="s2">Then march faster!</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.208" end="00:22:46.458" style="s2">The men&#39;s settlement<br />lies beyond this ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.708" end="00:22:47.708" style="s2">How long?</p>
<p begin="00:22:48.250" end="00:22:50.625" style="s2">We reach it by morning, my lord.</p>
<p begin="00:22:53.500" end="00:22:54.458" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:22:54.500" end="00:22:56.125" style="s2">Let them wake to us.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.375" end="00:23:02.917" style="s2">No rest until we see their walls. No rest!</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.125" end="00:23:45.125" style="s2">Soren?</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.333" end="00:23:51.333" style="s2">He&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.458" end="00:23:54.583" style="s2">Only for breakfast?</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.958" end="00:23:58.292" style="s2">I thought you&#39;d left us.</p>
<p begin="00:24:00.708" end="00:24:02.333" style="s2">I said I&#39;d take you somewhere safe.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.000" end="00:24:04.000" style="s2">Rabbit,</p>
<p begin="00:24:04.042" end="00:24:05.375" style="s2">not much, but it&#39;ll do.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.708" end="00:24:07.833" style="s2">You could have told me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.500" end="00:24:09.542" style="s2">You needed sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.250" end="00:24:21.333" style="s2">Does guarding the forest include cooking?</p>
<p begin="00:24:22.667" end="00:24:24.000" style="s2">Only when my guests are hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.500" end="00:24:30.208" style="s2">They&#39;re definitely your guests now.</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.875" end="00:24:32.542" style="s2">Then they&#39;d better<br />learn a little patience.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.708" end="00:24:38.708" style="s2">There we are.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.125" end="00:24:43.125" style="s2">Slowly,</p>
<p begin="00:24:43.500" end="00:24:44.750" style="s2">there&#39;s enough for everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:46.292" end="00:24:48.167" style="s2">Ember, manners.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.417" end="00:24:51.208" style="s2">A settlement lies past the hills.</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.875" end="00:24:52.958" style="s2">Will they help us?</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.583" end="00:24:54.958" style="s2">They&#39;ll help free your family</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.875" end="00:24:57.042" style="s2">and hide these five.</p>
<p begin="00:25:01.917" end="00:25:03.042" style="s2">Last one, Lyra.</p>
<p begin="00:25:04.375" end="00:25:05.667" style="s2">They eat better than I do.</p>
<p begin="00:25:12.875" end="00:25:13.875" style="s2">Back in, Ember.</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.417" end="00:25:19.417" style="s2">Everyone in?</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.625" end="00:25:20.625" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.625" end="00:25:24.708" style="s2">Leave nothing burning.</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.375" end="00:25:31.375" style="s2">Which way?</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.500" end="00:25:33.625" style="s2">Down through the pines.</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.500" end="00:25:44.875" style="s2">How far is this place?</p>
<p begin="00:25:46.167" end="00:25:47.333" style="s2">Beyond the lower ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.292" end="00:25:53.458" style="s2">You make it sound easy.</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.958" end="00:25:56.208" style="s2">Easy with breakfast.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.208" end="00:26:02.833" style="s2">They&#39;re enjoying this more than I am.</p>
<p begin="00:26:12.333" end="00:26:13.333" style="s2">It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.500" end="00:26:14.500" style="s2">huge.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.458" end="00:26:20.167" style="s2">The settlement is two days that way.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.917" end="00:26:23.917" style="s2">Two days?</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.125" end="00:26:25.458" style="s2">Auron will eat the sled.</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.083" end="00:26:27.167" style="s2">Then we&#39;d better hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.917" end="00:26:43.125" style="s2">Stay on the stones.</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.542" end="00:26:45.583" style="s2">It&#39;s freezing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:46.333" end="00:26:47.708" style="s2">That&#39;s why we don&#39;t fall in.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.125" end="00:26:52.417" style="s2">Freya!</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.333" end="00:26:57.500" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t falling.</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.292" end="00:26:59.292" style="s2">Of course not.</p>
<p begin="00:27:48.583" end="00:27:49.375" style="s2">Tommy!</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.417" end="00:27:50.417" style="s2">Doubt it!</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.000" end="00:27:57.000" style="s2">Sus!</p>
<p begin="00:28:00.625" end="00:28:02.500" style="s2">And turn of the dust!</p>
<p begin="00:28:05.875" end="00:28:07.625" style="s2">Tommy! Tommy&#39;s dead!</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.708" end="00:28:13.583" style="s2">Petitions from the valley, Majesty.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.542" end="00:28:15.833" style="s2">Begin with the millers.</p>
<p begin="00:28:18.708" end="00:28:20.667" style="s2">Our son, late again.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.375" end="00:28:25.583" style="s2">Forgive me, Father. The horses.<br />The horses, every morning.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.167" end="00:28:31.958" style="s2">One day this throne is yours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.833" end="00:28:33.917" style="s2">Then I will be early.</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.667" end="00:28:52.667" style="s2">Your</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.917" end="00:28:55.000" style="s2">feet, my prince.</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.375" end="00:28:56.458" style="s2">Always your feet.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.125" end="00:29:02.333" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.875" end="00:29:13.875" style="s2">Pell,</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.958" end="00:29:15.042" style="s2">apple or crossbow?</p>
<p begin="00:29:15.667" end="00:29:16.667" style="s2">Both, General.</p>
<p begin="00:29:17.000" end="00:29:18.000" style="s2">Ready for anything.</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.875" end="00:29:19.875" style="s2">Quiet road.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.125" end="00:29:21.125" style="s2">Two days now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.250" end="00:29:23.250" style="s2">No traders?</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.875" end="00:29:24.917" style="s2">Not one cart.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.667" end="00:29:29.750" style="s2">Double the watch.</p>
<p begin="00:29:30.250" end="00:29:31.417" style="s2">Eyes on the trees.</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.625" end="00:29:41.875" style="s2">Scouts came back,</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.167" end="00:29:43.167" style="s2">only two.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.917" end="00:29:44.917" style="s2">And the others?</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.375" end="00:29:46.667" style="s2">They did not come back.</p>
<p begin="00:29:50.833" end="00:29:52.542" style="s2">The trader roads went quiet as well.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.208" end="00:29:57.083" style="s2">Burned villages, iron boot tracks. Orcs?</p>
<p begin="00:29:57.375" end="00:29:58.458" style="s2">This far south?</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.958" end="00:30:02.125" style="s2">Rumors maybe,</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.583" end="00:30:04.167" style="s2">but I trust my scouts.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.000" end="00:30:12.478" style="s2">General, come, taste this.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.558" end="00:30:13.833" style="s2">Majesty,</p>
<p begin="00:30:14.083" end="00:30:15.184" style="s2">cancel the feast.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.264" end="00:30:16.708" style="s2">Cancel it? Why?</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.333" end="00:30:19.625" style="s2">Orcs in the north, scouts missing.</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.125" end="00:30:24.583" style="s2">Rumors do not take castles, Odran.</p>
<p begin="00:30:26.250" end="00:30:28.138" style="s2">These walls have stood for centuries.</p>
<p begin="00:30:28.218" end="00:30:30.458" style="s2">Father, let me ride out at dawn.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.125" end="00:30:32.250" style="s2">After the feast,</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.542" end="00:30:33.792" style="s2">tonight we celebrate.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.917" end="00:30:42.667" style="s2">Flour, Tobin. Forty loaves for the feast.</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.792" end="00:30:45.792" style="s2">Forty?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.958" end="00:30:47.208" style="s2">the king will burst.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.750" end="00:30:53.750" style="s2">Then</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.167" end="00:30:55.417" style="s2">he will burst happy.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.000" end="00:31:00.792" style="s2">One for you, do not tell.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.083" end="00:31:14.167" style="s2">Your watch, Reed.</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.000" end="00:31:17.750" style="s2">Feast inside, and I get the gate.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.708" end="00:31:20.250" style="s2">Someone has to keep it shut.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.917" end="00:31:43.958" style="s2">Welcome to Caer Veyr, my lords.</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.792" end="00:31:49.208" style="s2">Leave the book. Tonight you dance.</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.833" end="00:31:52.250" style="s2">Only if the music is good.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.875" end="00:32:13.000" style="s2">Soren, please.</p>
<p begin="00:32:13.375" end="00:32:14.417" style="s2">Just a moment.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.333" end="00:32:16.417" style="s2">We need to move on.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.500" end="00:32:20.542" style="s2">We cannot stop.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.125" end="00:32:22.125" style="s2">We are close.</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.583" end="00:32:23.667" style="s2">Close to what?</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.458" end="00:32:25.917" style="s2">To people who can help us.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.792" end="00:32:44.792" style="s2">Soren,</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.208" end="00:32:46.208" style="s2">look.</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.917" end="00:32:47.917" style="s2">Caer Veyr.</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.167" end="00:32:49.333" style="s2">King Edward&#39;s castle.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.833" end="00:32:52.917" style="s2">Will they help us?</p>
<p begin="00:32:53.333" end="00:32:54.333" style="s2">They must,</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.750" end="00:32:56.000" style="s2">before the orcs find them.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.583" end="00:33:18.750" style="s2">There it is.</p>
<p begin="00:33:19.583" end="00:33:21.417" style="s2">The stone house of the men.</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.583" end="00:33:24.250" style="s2">Lit like a feast.</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.875" end="00:33:29.125" style="s2">Do we march now?</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.833" end="00:33:30.833" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.083" end="00:33:33.083" style="s2">Put out the torches.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.125" end="00:33:44.833" style="s2">High walls, gate shut. Let them drink.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.083" end="00:33:48.167" style="s2">Let them dance. And then they sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.292" end="00:33:53.292" style="s2">We strike at dawn while they sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.667" end="00:33:56.167" style="s2">Their guards will be half asleep too.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.458" end="00:34:01.958" style="s2">The dark is with us.</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.292" end="00:34:03.667" style="s2">No fires.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.125" end="00:34:05.458" style="s2">No sound.</p>
<p begin="00:34:10.708" end="00:34:12.917" style="s2">Quiet, not a sound.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.417" end="00:34:22.750" style="s2">Sleep, men,</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.042" end="00:34:24.375" style="s2">sleep deep.</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.833" end="00:34:41.042" style="s2">To Caer Veyr,</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.292" end="00:34:43.125" style="s2">300 years.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.458" end="00:34:45.375" style="s2">To Caer Veyr!</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.667" end="00:34:49.833" style="s2">And 300 more!</p>
<p begin="00:34:56.458" end="00:34:57.583" style="s2">The music is good!</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.500" end="00:35:12.500" style="s2">Your feet will not help you here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.375" end="00:35:17.958" style="s2">Who</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.708" end="00:35:20.708" style="s2">is down now?</p>
<p begin="00:35:23.000" end="00:35:24.083" style="s2">Listen to them in there.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.000" end="00:35:26.000" style="s2">Listen out here.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.958" end="00:35:39.000" style="s2">Good night, my lord.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.292" end="00:35:40.333" style="s2">Mind the steps.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.417" end="00:35:47.667" style="s2">A good night, Edric.</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.542" end="00:35:49.833" style="s2">The best in years.</p>
<p begin="00:35:51.333" end="00:35:52.375" style="s2">Odran looked worried.</p>
<p begin="00:35:54.042" end="00:35:55.542" style="s2">Odran always looks worried.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.917" end="00:36:20.042" style="s2">Long night,</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.208" end="00:36:23.417" style="s2">longer day coming.</p>
<p begin="00:37:03.792" end="00:37:06.167" style="s2">How</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.750" end="00:37:08.750" style="s2">much further?</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.375" end="00:37:11.333" style="s2">Half a day, maybe less.</p>
<p begin="00:37:14.708" end="00:37:15.708" style="s2">Soren,</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.083" end="00:37:17.083" style="s2">what is that?</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.958" end="00:37:18.958" style="s2">Keep walking.</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.333" end="00:37:20.333" style="s2">You will see.</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.208" end="00:37:38.333" style="s2">By the gods.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.333" end="00:37:40.333" style="s2">Caer Veyr,</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.583" end="00:37:41.917" style="s2">the castle of King Edward.</p>
<p begin="00:37:42.458" end="00:37:44.208" style="s2">It is bigger than our whole village.</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.667" end="00:37:45.667" style="s2">Ten villages,</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.958" end="00:37:46.958" style="s2">maybe twenty.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.167" end="00:37:54.375" style="s2">I never left home,</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.917" end="00:37:55.917" style="s2">not once.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.417" end="00:37:57.417" style="s2">Now you have.</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.333" end="00:38:05.958" style="s2">Who could build something like that?</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.208" end="00:38:07.083" style="s2">Men,</p>
<p begin="00:38:07.125" end="00:38:09.917" style="s2">stone by stone, over many lifetimes.</p>
<p begin="00:38:10.167" end="00:38:11.792" style="s2">Fathers, then sons.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.292" end="00:38:14.357" style="s2">How do they lift stones so high?</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.437" end="00:38:16.583" style="s2">Ropes, oxen, and stubborn kings.</p>
<p begin="00:38:20.833" end="00:38:22.703" style="s2">And people live inside it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:22.783" end="00:38:25.708" style="s2">Thousands. Soldiers, merchants, a king.</p>
<p begin="00:38:34.333" end="00:38:36.125" style="s2">We thought the forest was the world.</p>
<p begin="00:38:36.833" end="00:38:37.917" style="s2">The world is bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.625" end="00:38:41.958" style="s2">Mountains, seas,</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.500" end="00:38:43.917" style="s2">cities of stone.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.958" end="00:38:45.958" style="s2">Will I see them?</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.250" end="00:38:48.500" style="s2">If we live long enough.</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.208" end="00:38:52.208" style="s2">We will.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.458" end="00:38:53.458" style="s2">We will.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.167" end="00:38:55.167" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.375" end="00:39:04.375" style="s2">Look,</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.875" end="00:39:05.958" style="s2">that is where we go.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.542" end="00:39:09.542" style="s2">Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.875" end="00:39:11.125" style="s2">Men fear dragons.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.708" end="00:39:13.792" style="s2">Even little ones?</p>
<p begin="00:39:14.583" end="00:39:15.583" style="s2">Little ones grow.</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.208" end="00:39:24.750" style="s2">Hide them until we meet the king.</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.458" end="00:39:37.708" style="s2">Step where I step.</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.542" end="00:39:40.625" style="s2">The ice is thin.</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.292" end="00:39:43.417" style="s2">Then step quickly.</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.417" end="00:41:05.458" style="s2">Ash in your blood.</p>
<p begin="00:41:07.708" end="00:41:10.375" style="s2">Iron in your hands.</p>
<p begin="00:41:16.375" end="00:41:18.250" style="s2">Ash and iron.</p>
<p begin="00:41:51.417" end="00:41:54.333" style="s2">Today the stone house falls.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.833" end="00:42:14.792" style="s2">Up, up. Bread will not bake itself.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.875" end="00:42:17.875" style="s2">My</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.958" end="00:42:21.042" style="s2">head is still at the feast.</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.583" end="00:42:25.042" style="s2">Then carry it to the market.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.958" end="00:42:30.958" style="s2">Gheart.</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.000" end="00:42:32.000" style="s2">Ugh!</p>
<p begin="00:42:34.917" end="00:42:37.000" style="s2">Morning, Reed, feeling alive?</p>
<p begin="00:42:38.375" end="00:42:39.375" style="s2">Barely.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.917" end="00:42:40.917" style="s2">Hurry up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.375" end="00:42:42.375" style="s2">Come on up.</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.208" end="00:42:44.208" style="s2">Go!</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.000" end="00:42:48.000" style="s2">Just crows.</p>
<p begin="00:43:04.625" end="00:43:06.875" style="s2">Apples, fresh from the valley.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.667" end="00:43:14.667" style="s2">Morning, Mara.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.208" end="00:43:16.208" style="s2">Sergeant,</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.542" end="00:43:17.542" style="s2">hungry.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.458" end="00:43:33.917" style="s2">My head is a drum.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.500" end="00:43:35.958" style="s2">You drank half the dairy.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.875" end="00:43:44.458" style="s2">Nothing out there but trees.</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.667" end="00:43:47.042" style="s2">That is what worries me.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.458" end="00:44:07.458" style="s2">Low.</p>
<p begin="00:44:07.667" end="00:44:08.958" style="s2">Stay low.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.875" end="00:44:36.375" style="s2">Slow. Loose stones will sing.</p>
<p begin="00:45:10.000" end="00:45:11.292" style="s2">Hook&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.458" end="00:45:13.583" style="s2">Ready.</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.417" end="00:45:44.667" style="s2">One sound,</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.208" end="00:45:46.750" style="s2">and you answer to me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.250" end="00:46:05.333" style="s2">Their guards drank all night.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.208" end="00:46:08.333" style="s2">Then we wake them ourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.000" end="00:46:10.708" style="s2">The mountain line is ready.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.292" end="00:46:12.708" style="s2">The river line too.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.292" end="00:46:22.250" style="s2">Wait for my sign.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.167" end="00:46:47.583" style="s2">Is their mother still out there?</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.875" end="00:46:49.917" style="s2">Nobody knows.</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.792" end="00:46:55.250" style="s2">Then where did the eggs come from?</p>
<p begin="00:46:58.542" end="00:47:00.292" style="s2">The Dark Lord wants to know too.</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.458" end="00:47:08.458" style="s2">Not from me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:15.583" end="00:47:16.792" style="s2">How big will they grow?</p>
<p begin="00:47:18.375" end="00:47:19.792" style="s2">Bigger than the castle gate.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.375" end="00:47:22.792" style="s2">Then I need a bigger sled.</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.375" end="00:47:27.250" style="s2">Each</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.833" end="00:47:30.250" style="s2">one will choose a rider.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.208" end="00:47:33.208" style="s2">Choose?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.333" end="00:47:35.667" style="s2">They already chose you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.292" end="00:47:46.708" style="s2">Auron hatched first.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.667" end="00:47:51.250" style="s2">Skeld bites everything.</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.708" end="00:47:56.250" style="s2">Ember always smokes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:00.167" end="00:48:01.750" style="s2">Vael sleeps all day.</p>
<p begin="00:48:04.625" end="00:48:06.125" style="s2">And Lyra sings at night.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.792" end="00:50:03.417" style="s2">Orcs! On the walls!</p>
<p begin="00:50:06.167" end="00:50:08.292" style="s2">Right here!</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.042" end="00:50:33.125" style="s2">Keep ringing!</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.833" end="00:51:09.833" style="s2">With me, we own Tract.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.042" end="00:51:42.500" style="s2">Fall back to the tower!</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.292" end="00:51:45.292" style="s2">Dad!</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.958" end="00:52:09.500" style="s2">Murestai!</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.500" end="00:52:35.083" style="s2">Majesty! Orcs on the walls!</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.917" end="00:52:38.917" style="s2">My sword.</p>
<p begin="00:52:39.375" end="00:52:40.375" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.458" end="00:52:44.458" style="s2">Edric!</p>
<p begin="00:52:45.000" end="00:52:46.000" style="s2">The children!</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.417" end="00:52:47.917" style="s2">Garen, find them.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.958" end="00:52:59.292" style="s2">Go! On your feet!</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.333" end="00:53:05.208" style="s2">Orcs on the walls! To the barracks!</p>
<p begin="00:53:06.458" end="00:53:07.500" style="s2">Who holds the gate?</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.833" end="00:53:08.833" style="s2">Reed is there.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.250" end="00:53:10.250" style="s2">Go!</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.833" end="00:53:29.125" style="s2">Helmets! Shields! Move!</p>
<p begin="00:53:39.542" end="00:53:41.438" style="s2">Every blade to the courtyard!</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.518" end="00:53:42.583" style="s2">Yes, General.</p>
<p begin="00:53:59.083" end="00:54:01.875" style="s2">Inside! Get inside the houses!</p>
<p begin="00:54:05.833" end="00:54:06.833" style="s2">Ronto!</p>
<p begin="00:54:15.208" end="00:54:17.125" style="s2">Joy, here you must stay!</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.375" end="00:54:25.375" style="s2">Kalen,</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.417" end="00:54:26.487" style="s2">where is Father?</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.567" end="00:54:28.292" style="s2">The Great Hall. Stay close.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.750" end="00:54:36.250" style="s2">This way, my ladies.</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.292" end="00:54:46.292" style="s2">Stay together.</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.500" end="00:54:47.583" style="s2">Stay behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:54:53.500" end="00:54:56.000" style="s2">Shield up! Form on me!</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.500" end="00:55:06.083" style="s2">The gate must hold!</p>
<p begin="00:55:13.667" end="00:55:14.917" style="s2">For Caer Veyr!</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.333" end="00:55:16.542" style="s2">For Caer Veyr!</p>
<p begin="00:55:16.833" end="00:55:20.375" style="s2">For Caer Veyr! For Caer Veyr!</p>
<p begin="00:55:35.750" end="00:55:37.750" style="s2">Push!</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.667" end="00:55:42.833" style="s2">Push them back!</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.083" end="00:56:18.292" style="s2">Hold the gate!</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.542" end="00:56:19.583" style="s2">Hold it!</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.333" end="00:56:24.833" style="s2">Not this gate!</p>
<p begin="00:56:56.875" end="00:56:57.875" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="00:57:20.083" end="00:57:21.083" style="s2">Archers!</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.417" end="00:57:22.417" style="s2">Loose!</p>
<p begin="00:57:29.708" end="00:57:30.750" style="s2">Run on!</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.583" end="00:57:47.583" style="s2">Shields!</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.583" end="00:58:07.708" style="s2">Break them!</p>
<p begin="00:58:29.625" end="00:58:32.167" style="s2">Garen!</p>
<p begin="00:58:56.542" end="00:58:58.542" style="s2">Hold!</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.125" end="00:59:09.083" style="s2">Here!</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.125" end="00:59:10.125" style="s2">Hold!</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.750" end="00:59:39.750" style="s2">You&#39;re next!</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.958" end="00:59:54.500" style="s2">Not this street.</p>
<p begin="01:00:21.042" end="01:00:23.042" style="s2">Stand!</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.833" end="01:00:26.875" style="s2">With me! Stand!</p>
<p begin="01:01:11.250" end="01:01:14.917" style="s2">Shh.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.458" end="01:01:20.458" style="s2">Temple jump!</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.792" end="01:01:25.833" style="s2">Vigil tight!</p>
<p begin="01:01:34.083" end="01:01:35.250" style="s2">Hey, bullseye!</p>
<p begin="01:02:06.417" end="01:02:07.750" style="s2">Burn it all!</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.500" end="01:02:32.500" style="s2">Up!</p>
<p begin="01:02:35.042" end="01:02:36.042" style="s2">Again.</p>
<p begin="01:03:49.125" end="01:03:50.625" style="s2">The castle is under attack.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.542" end="01:03:55.583" style="s2">We must fight.</p>
<p begin="01:03:59.667" end="01:04:00.708" style="s2">We can&#39;t help them.</p>
<p begin="01:04:01.583" end="01:04:02.583" style="s2">There are too many.</p>
<p begin="01:04:14.167" end="01:04:15.167" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.792" end="01:04:18.833" style="s2">You said I am the mother of the dragons.</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.958" end="01:04:21.458" style="s2">I will save those people.</p>
<p begin="01:04:24.250" end="01:04:25.417" style="s2">They are too small.</p>
<p begin="01:04:26.542" end="01:04:27.792" style="s2">You have no armor.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.208" end="01:04:32.417" style="s2">We will all die.</p>
<p begin="01:04:48.583" end="01:04:50.333" style="s2">If I can&#39;t save these people,</p>
<p begin="01:04:51.250" end="01:04:53.083" style="s2">how can I save my family?</p>
<p begin="01:05:31.800" end="01:05:33.917" style="s2">What are they doing?</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.292" end="01:05:39.292" style="s2">I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:07:22.667" end="01:07:23.667" style="s2">Whoa!</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.417" end="01:08:43.500" style="s2">By the gods.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.333" end="01:09:15.333" style="s2">Freya!</p>
<p begin="01:10:22.875" end="01:10:25.000" style="s2">Move! It&#39;s coming down!</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.375" end="01:10:41.625" style="s2">For Teravol!</p>
<p begin="01:11:07.667" end="01:11:09.667" style="s2">Run to the keep!</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.000" end="01:12:34.458" style="s2">Dragons, bring them down!</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.458" end="01:13:10.917" style="s2">With her forward!</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.792" end="01:14:10.417" style="s2">Take it down!</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.792" end="01:14:13.792" style="s2">Look out!</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.875" end="01:14:42.917" style="s2">It is lost! Fly!</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.042" end="01:14:45.333" style="s2">Fall back!</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.000" end="01:15:32.208" style="s2">The Dragon Girl.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.917" end="01:15:51.333" style="s2">You saved my people.</p>
<p begin="01:16:51.083" end="01:16:53.458" style="s2">The girl has dragons now.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.292" end="01:16:56.792" style="s2">Then we will find bigger ones.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.800" end="01:17:23.583" style="s2">You did it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.958" end="01:17:25.958" style="s2">We did it.</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.167" end="01:17:50.167" style="s2">What now?</p>
<p begin="01:17:54.500" end="01:17:55.917" style="s2">Now we find my family.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
